&lt;hr&gt;If a 84/355" drill bit is unavailble, use a 15/64".&lt;br&gt;If a 34/209" drill bit is unavailble, use an 11/64".
&lt;hr&gt;&amp;micro;2011.05.30 D Lue Choy</description>
