<devicesets>
<deviceset name="JSMS">
<description>&lt;h3&gt;Sega SG-1000, SC-3000, Mark III, Japanese Master System cartridge port&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;Note that the SG-1000 and SC-3000 have the same connector worldwide.&lt;br&gt;The function of pin B9 is uncertain at present. It may be CE, Refresh or NC.&lt;br&gt;Korean variants such as the Gam*Boy have the same connector. &lt;/ul&gt;
description taken from SMSPower.org&lt;hr&gt;&amp;micro; 2011.01.17 D Lue Choy</description>
<gates>
